      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رِيفِىٌّ</span></b>  [<i>Of,</i> or <i>belonging to, the</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رِيف</span>, or <i>region
of cultivated land;</i> opposed to <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَرِّىٌّ</span>;] applied to a
plant [&amp;c.]. (M, voce <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عُصْفُرٌ</span>.) And <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَرْضٌ رِيفِيَّةٌ</span>
<i>Cultivated land; contr. of</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَرِّيَّةٌ</span>. (IAar, and M
and K * and TA in art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بر</span>.)

